le 6 6 6\n1331 median 1.0 feasible 3 3 3\n1331 median 0.5 unattainable 0 7 7\n1331 borda 1.0 feasible 6 6 6\n1331 borda 0.5 unattainable 0 7 7\n1870 mean 1.0 feasible 4 4 4\n1870 mean 0.5 unattainable 0 7 7\n1870 median 1.0 feasible 4 4 4\n1870 median 0.5 unattainable 0 7 7\n1870 borda 1.0 feasible 6 6 6\n1870 borda 0.5 unattainable 0 7 7\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
